From: Steve Slivinski <stesli@github.local>
Subject: [PATCH] ozone: pass format modifier in per-plane EGL_LINUX_DMA_BUF import

The per-plane EGL_LINUX_DMA_BUF import branch (taken when plane_index_
is set, i.e. when chromium imports NV12 luma as R8 and chroma as GR88
separately on the Linux V4L2 path) was missing
EGL_DMA_BUF_PLANE0_MODIFIER_{LO,HI}_EXT. The multi-plane branch above
already passes them. For LINEAR buffers this is harmless, but for tiled
formats like DRM_FORMAT_MOD_BROADCOM_SAND128 (Pi5 V4L2 HEVC capture)
Mesa then interprets the dma-buf as linear and samples garbage, which
presents as uniform green frames during HEVC playback.

Also LOG the per-plane import attrs so we can verify the modifier is
making it through at runtime.
diff --git a/ui/ozone/common/native_pixmap_egl_binding.cc b/ui/ozone/common/native_pixmap_egl_binding.cc
index 393e892..151bd73 100644
--- a/ui/ozone/common/native_pixmap_egl_binding.cc
+++ b/ui/ozone/common/native_pixmap_egl_binding.cc
@@ -223,6 +223,32 @@ bool NativePixmapEGLBinding::InitializeFromNativePixmap(
     attrs.push_back(pixmap->GetDmaBufOffset(pixmap_plane));
     attrs.push_back(EGL_DMA_BUF_PLANE0_PITCH_EXT);
     attrs.push_back(pixmap->GetDmaBufPitch(pixmap_plane));
+
+    // AGORA_PATCH_0017: pass the format modifier in the per-plane EGL
+    // import too. The original upstream code only includes
+    // EGL_DMA_BUF_PLANE0_MODIFIER_{LO,HI}_EXT in the multi-plane branch
+    // above, leaving the per-plane import with no modifier. For LINEAR
+    // buffers that is harmless, but for tiled formats like
+    // DRM_FORMAT_MOD_BROADCOM_SAND128 (Pi5 V4L2 HEVC capture output)
+    // Mesa then treats the dma-buf as linear and samples garbage, which
+    // presents as uniform green frames in HEVC playback.
+    bool has_dma_buf_import_modifier =
+        gl::GLSurfaceEGL::GetGLDisplayEGL()
+            ->ext->b_EGL_EXT_image_dma_buf_import_modifiers;
+    uint64_t modifier = pixmap->GetFormatModifier();
+    if (has_dma_buf_import_modifier &&
+        modifier != gfx::NativePixmapHandle::kNoModifier) {
+      attrs.push_back(EGL_DMA_BUF_PLANE0_MODIFIER_LO_EXT);
+      attrs.push_back(modifier & 0xffffffff);
+      attrs.push_back(EGL_DMA_BUF_PLANE0_MODIFIER_HI_EXT);
+      attrs.push_back(static_cast<uint32_t>(modifier >> 32));
+    }
+    LOG(WARNING) << "AGORA_PERPLANE_IMPORT plane=" << pixmap_plane
+                 << " fd=" << pixmap->GetDmaBufFd(pixmap_plane)
+                 << " offset=" << pixmap->GetDmaBufOffset(pixmap_plane)
+                 << " pitch=" << pixmap->GetDmaBufPitch(pixmap_plane)
+                 << " mod=0x" << std::hex << modifier << std::dec
+                 << " has_mod_ext=" << has_dma_buf_import_modifier;
     attrs.push_back(EGL_NONE);
   }
 
